# Firebase admin service-account keys are secrets. storage/app/.gitignore keeps
# storage/app/private/* out of git while still shipping the directory itself;
# this extra rule catches a key downloaded from the console into the repo root,
# which is where Google's default naming lands it.
/*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
